id: date/local-setter/0001
area: date
op: local setters, read back
in: str:"d.setFullYear(9999, 11, 31); d.setDate(32)"
out: value: str:"10000,0,1,12"
class: normative
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.prototype.setfullyear spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.prototype.setmonth spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.prototype.setdate spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.prototype.sethours spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-makeday spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-utc-t spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-localtime ref:dateref@1
script: var d = new Date(2000, 0, 1, 12); d.setFullYear(9999, 11, 31); d.setDate(32); [d.getFullYear(), d.getMonth(), d.getDate(), d.getHours()].join()
note: a local date put in and read back, so the outcome holds in every time zone
since: 14

id: date/local-setter/0002
